### Collab module — HTTP collection
### Usable directly with the VS Code "REST Client" / JetBrains HTTP Client extensions,
### or copy each request into curl/Postman. See docs/api/collab-API.md for full docs.
###
### Setup: register/login an ARTIST and a PRODUCER first via users' /api/auth
### endpoints (docs/api/users-API.md), then set @artistToken/@producerToken below.
### Also needs an existing beatId from the catalog module.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@artistToken = REPLACE_WITH_ARTIST_SESSION_TOKEN
@producerToken = REPLACE_WITH_PRODUCER_SESSION_TOKEN
@beatId = 1

### 1. POST /api/toplines — artist uploads a topline over a beat
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/toplines
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{artistToken}}

{
  "beatId": {{beatId}},
  "audioUrl": "https://soundcloud.com/example/topline"
}

### 2. GET /api/toplines — list, filtered by beat
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/toplines?beatId={{beatId}}

### 2b. GET /api/toplines/{id} — single topline
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/toplines/1

### 3. PUT /api/collaborations/{id} — producer accepts (or rejects) the collaboration
### created automatically by request #1 above. Replace 1 with the real collaboration id.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/collaborations/1?status=ACCEPTED
Authorization: Bearer {{producerToken}}

### 3b. GET /api/collaborations — list, filtered by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/collaborations?status=PENDING

### 4. POST /api/toplines/{toplineId}/comments — comment on a topline
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/toplines/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{producerToken}}

{
  "text": "Qué voz!"
}

### 5. GET /api/toplines/{toplineId}/comments — list comments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/toplines/1/comments
